        <td width="414" height="2">
            <p><font size="3"><b>◈</b></font><b><font size="3"> Dry Laminating Process</font></b></p>
            <p><font size="2">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;This process coats the printed film or non-printed&nbsp;film</font></p>
            <p><font size="2">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; with the adhesive diluted with organic agent,&nbsp;makes it</font></p>
            <p><font size="2">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; pass through the dry hood, and joins it&nbsp;while pressurizing</font></p>
            <p><font size="2">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; with other textile.</font></p>
